# ---- Presentation render byproducts (slide/QA image exports, office temp & lock files) ----
# Keep: the .pptx/.pdf deck, week3/diagrams/**, and week3/mlflow-*.png screenshots.
# Ignore: the per-slide .jpg exports and QA thumbnails at the week3/ root, plus LibreOffice temp/lock files.
